"This page describes the stages of prebuilt transpilation pipeline in the Qiskit SDK. There are six stages:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Inilalarawan ng pahinang ito ang mga yugto ng prebuilt transpilation pipeline sa Qiskit SDK. May anim na yugto:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`init`\n"
msgstr "`init`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`layout`\n"
msgstr "`layout`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`routing`\n"
msgstr "`routing`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`translation`\n"
msgstr "`translation`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
