#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/extracted-outputs/ae2d9390-5c26-46f3-9418-a684ba8a406a-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/extracted-outputs/ae2d9390-5c26-46f3-9418-a684ba8a406a-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Circuit with delay instructions](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/transpiler-16.avif)\n"
msgstr "![circuit na may mga delay na tagubilin](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/transpiler-16.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The transpiler inserted `Delay` instructions to account for idle time on each qubit. To get a better idea of the timing of the circuit we can also look at it with the `timeline.draw()` function:\n"
msgstr "Naglagay ang Transpiler ng mga tagubiling `Delay` para isaalang-alang ang idle time sa bawat qubit. Para mas maintindihan ang timing ng circuit maaari rin nating tingnan ito gamit ang function na `timeline.draw()`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![timeline.draw() view of the same circuit](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/transpiler-17.svg)\n"
"Scheduling a circuit involves two parts: analysis and constraint mapping, followed by a padding pass.  The first part requires running a scheduling analysis pass (by default this is [`ALAPSchedulingAnalysis`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.ALAPScheduleAnalysis)), which analyzes the circuit and records the start time of each instruction in the circuit into a schedule.  Once the circuit has an initial schedule, additional passes can be run to account for any timing constraints on the target backend.  Finally, a padding pass such as [`PadDelay`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.PadDelay) or [`PadDynamicalDecoupling`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.PadDynamicalDecoupling) can be executed.\n"
msgstr ""
"![timeline.draw() na view ng parehong circuit](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/transpiler-17.svg)\n"
"Ang pag-schedule ng isang circuit ay nagsasangkot ng dalawang bahagi: analysis at constraint mapping, na sinusundan ng isang padding pass.  Ang unang bahagi ay nangangailangan ng pagpapatakbo ng scheduling analysis pass (bilang default ito ay [`ALAPSchedulingAnalysis`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.ALAPScheduleAnalysis)), na nag-aanalisa ng circuit at nagtatala ng oras ng pagsisimula ng bawat tagubilin sa circuit sa isang schedule.  Kapag mayroon nang paunang schedule ang circuit, maaaring patakbuhin ang mga karagdagang pass para tugunan ang anumang timing constraint sa target na Backend.  Panghuli, maaaring isagawa ang isang padding pass tulad ng [`PadDelay`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.PadDelay) o [`PadDynamicalDecoupling`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.PadDynamicalDecoupling).\n"

